<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">All Blacks' pre-match haka</span><span class="sg-chain-h">choreographed, synchronised version</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Kiwis' (rugby league) pre-match haka</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">until 2013</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same haka</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Ka Mate ballad (Glen Osborne)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2021</span><span class="sg-chain-h">adapted as a ballad in C major</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Māori civilisation theme in Civilization VI: Gathering Storm (Geoff Knorr and Phill Boucher)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2019</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in, with &quot;Pōkarekare Ana&quot;</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Protest against the Treaty Principles Bill in the New Zealand Parliament</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2024</span><span class="sg-chain-h">performed as protest</span></li></ul></section>
